TY  - JOUR
TI  - JAS-mine: A new platform for microsimulation and agent-based modelling
AU  - Richiardi, Matteo G.
AU  - Richardson, Ross E.
VL  - 10
IS  - 1
PY  - 2017
DA  - 2017/04/30
